{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0323D0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"奥古斯托·塞萨尔·桑地诺……桑地诺将军是尼加拉瓜的英雄。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"50年前，尼加拉瓜的政党之间爆发了内乱。美国海军陆战队以平息冲突为名介入。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"面对要求讲和的海军陆战队，只有桑地诺将军拒绝接受。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"敢和美国海军陆战队对着干，胆子真不小。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"AUX_ONE_MAN_ADDITION_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"将军原本并不是军人，他的同伴也一样。当然，他们的装备也比不上海军陆战队。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"因此他充分利用地利，驰骋在<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>的山野之间，以神出鬼没的战术把海军陆战队耍得团团转。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>","cn_utf8_bytes":140,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_PROPER_NAME;JPN_ELUSIVE_TACTICS_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我知道。游击战的教科书里也提到过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":"AUX_PLENTY_TEXTBOOKS_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"结果海军陆战队撤退了。他正是我们的榜样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"说到50年前，应该也受到了世界大萧条的影响吧？驻扎军队可是很花钱的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"AUX_GARRISON_COST_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"也许吧。不过将军的功绩是毋庸置疑的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"人们欢欣鼓舞。他被称为『<R=自由人的将军,General de Hombres Libres>』，深受人民爱戴。可是……","cn_control_tokens":"<R=自由人的将军,General de Hombres Libres>","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_SPANISH_READING;JPN_LOVED_BY_PEOPLE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"他被暗杀了。下手的是国民警卫队司令阿纳斯塔西奥·索摩查·加西亚。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"就是现在这个索摩查的父亲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"索摩查背后也有美国支持。就是这么回事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"即使将军被杀了，他的意志也由我们继承。哪怕时代已经不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"JPN_INHERITED_WILL_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"我们就是将军的女儿和儿子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""}]}